    it''s my fault. No need to bring this over to her.","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":464,"yPos":451},"ID":25,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"She
    ran out of the store with teary eyes.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":460,"yPos":561},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
    that girl, she has true potential and I ruined it. Let me compensate the damages
    here.","parentUIDs":[24],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":35}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":168,"yPos":672},"ID":27,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I''m
    not mad at her... I''m just confused whether I''m doing the right thing.","parentUIDs":[26],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":36}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":454,"yPos":674},"ID":35,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wait,
    what do you mean?","parentUIDs":[27],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":37}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":165,"yPos":781},"ID":36,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    set everything up, just let Alice have an experience of cyberdiving. But I guess
    that didn''t work.","parentUIDs":[35],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":38}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":456,"yPos":779},"ID":37,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    am sorry, Roux. You should''ve told me about this. But still, handling malwares
    like these are dangerous.","parentUIDs":[36],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":39}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":163,"yPos":897},"ID":38,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    know. Maybe today is just a bad day. I''ll make up with Alice and do some explaining.","parentUIDs":[37],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":42}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":456,"yPos":891},"ID":39,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Sorry
    for today Roux, I''ll be going now.","parentUIDs":[38],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":459,"yPos":1008},"ID":40,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    understand. See you then, Roux.","parentUIDs":[42],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":40}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":164,"yPos":1006},"ID":42,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Yeah,
    sure. Since the computer''s broken and all, I may have to close the shop for
    some repairs. ","parentUIDs":[39],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Roux","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1}]}'
